        <title>Cosy入门</title>
        <link rel="alternate" href="https://blog.genesisx.cn/2024/12/24/hexo/Cosy%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8/"/>
        <content type="html">&lt;h3 id=&#34;纯粹的折腾-💡&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#纯粹的折腾-💡&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;纯粹的折腾 💡&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;纯粹的折腾 💡&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://hexo.maxshader.com/posts/59577/&#34;&gt;Cosy 主题入门配置💡&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;以这个开源 Theme 为基础增加了以下&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;增加-footer-配置-🦢&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#增加-footer-配置-🦢&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;增加 footer 配置 🦢&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;增加 footer 配置 🦢&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre class=&#34;line-numbers language-yaml&#34; data-language=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token comment&#34;&gt;# Footer info&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;footer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;enable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;token boolean important&#34;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;since&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;token number&#34;&gt;2024&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class=&#34;token comment&#34;&gt;# Customize the server domain name ICP&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;ICP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;enable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;token boolean important&#34;&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;token string&#34;&gt;&#34;粤ICP备18155512号-1&#34;&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;token string&#34;&gt;&#34;https://beian.miit.gov.cn/&#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;line-numbers-rows&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&#34;增加中间动态欢迎语-👋&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#增加中间动态欢迎语-👋&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;增加中间动态欢迎语 👋&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;增加中间动态欢迎语 👋&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://gyoliu.github.io/&#34; title=&#34;效果博客👋&#34;&gt;效果博客&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;/img/home.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;INFO-Error-has-occurred-during-indexing-posts-object-Object&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#INFO-Error-has-occurred-during-indexing-posts-object-Object&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;INFO  Error has occurred during indexing posts : [object Object]&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;INFO  Error has occurred during indexing posts : [object Object]&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://yfzhu.cn/posts/1011/&#34;&gt;解决方案&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&#34;line-numbers language-yaml&#34; data-language=&#34;yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-yaml&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token comment&#34;&gt;#algolia Configuration&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;algolia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;chunkSize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;token number&#34;&gt;5000&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class=&#34;token key atrule&#34;&gt;fields&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; content&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;strip&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;truncate&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token number&#34;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token punctuation&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;token number&#34;&gt;5000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; class=&#34;line-numbers-rows&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;



</content>
